    {
      "transcript_index": 8,
      "transcript_timestamp_ms": 1789746914329,
      "text": "You mentioned driving five to ten kilometres a day in city traffic with a child seat and stroller, focusing on practicality and running costs. We'll start with boot capacity and child safety, look at cabin technology, and finish with written ownership terms.",
